efore, the rabbit does see the cat, making the statement "The rabbit does not see the cat" false.\n\nBut wait, earlier I thought statement 12 says the rabbit sees the bald eagle, but that doesn\'t necessarily mean it sees the cat. However, statement 15 adds another condition that leads to the rabbit seeing the cat. So, combining both, the rabbit must see the cat. Therefore, my final option is: ']]  4%|4         | 24/600 [07:43<30:13,  3.15s/it]
