 cold doesn't affect his color directly, but since all green people are nice, and all nice people are blue, Charlie being green makes him nice, and thus blue.\n\nI don't see any information that would suggest Charlie is not blue. So based on the given statements, Charlie should be blue.\n. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
