n Bob is big. But Bob is green and nice, so he\'s big, which aligns with rule 12 because he\'s nice and quiet, so he\'s big.\n\nBut that doesn\'t affect Dave. So, Dave\'s niceness is determined by the rules as above. Therefore, my final option is: ']] 17%|#7        | 104/600 [48:29<3:16:41, 23.79s/it]
