ry\'s color, so that\'s not directly relevant to being round.\n\nI don\'t see any information about Harry\'s shape being round. The facts talk about his fur, niceness, quietness, and color, but nothing about his size or shape. So, I can\'t determine if Harry is round based on the given information. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
