nd round, according to this rule, she must be rough. So that would make the statement "Erin is rough" true.\n\nWait, but let me check if there\'s any information that contradicts this. Point 6 says all rough people are smart, and Erin is smart, so that\'s consistent. Point 7 says if someone is blue and rough, they are smart, which is also true for Erin because she\'s blue and smart. Point 8 says all nice, rough people are smart, which again applies to Erin.\n\nSo, putting it all together, since Erin is nice and round, she must be rough according to point 9. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
