mes these logic problems can have hidden implications or indirect information.\n\nPoint 3 says Charlie is cold, green, and nice. So that\'s a direct statement. There\'s no contradiction or additional information that would change this. The other points talk about other people like Anne, Bob, Gary, and the relationships between their attributes, but they don\'t affect Charlie\'s status as nice. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
