. But we know Fiona is big (statement 5) and furry (statement 6). From statement 15, all furry, green people are smart. But wait, we don't know if Fiona is green yet. Let me check if Fiona is green.\n\nFrom statement 8: All kind people are cold. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
