** (from step 3).\n- **Anne is young** (from step 5).\n- **If Anne is kind, then she is rough** (from step 6).\n- However, we don't have information about whether Anne is kind or not.\n\nSince we don't have enough information to confirm whether Anne is kind or not, we cannot definitively say whether she is rough or not.\n\n### Final Answer:\n\\boxed{C}",
