being round and quiet leading to her being smart, but that doesn\'t affect Bob. So, Bob being big implies he\'s round, regardless of other people\'s statuses.\n\nI don\'t see any contradictions here. So, based on the given information, Bob being big leads directly to him being round. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
