affect whether the bald eagle is eating the squirrel.\n\nTherefore, the only thing we know is that the bald eagle is chasing the squirrel, but we don\'t know if it\'s eating it. So, the statement could be true or false, but we can\'t determine it definitively. Therefore, the answer is unknown.\n\nWait, but I\'m getting confused because statement 14 is about the squirrel eating something leading to it eating the bald eagle. It doesn\'t say anything about the bald eagle eating the squirrel. So, the bald eagle could be eating the squirrel, or not, based on other factors not provided. Therefore, my final option is: ']] 80%|#######9  | 479/600 [1:48:12<01:18,  1.54it/s]
