point 15, big people are red, which we\'ve already established.\n\nNow, the question is about Gary being white. Let\'s see if there\'s any information about white. From point 8, Charlie is red and not white. So, Charlie is red, but that doesn\'t say anything about white. However, point 17 says that if someone is red, they are cold, but it doesn\'t say anything about white.\n\nLooking at point 18, which isn\'t explicitly listed, but from the given points, we don\'t have any information about white. The only mention of color is that Charlie is red and not white. So, white isn\'t mentioned for anyone else.\n\nTherefore, we don\'t have any information that would allow us to conclude whether Gary is white or not. We know he\'s red and big and quiet, but nothing about his color being white. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
